(sustained), the median of 2 rounds:

    shape at tokens              old chunks    new chunks    fresh old  fresh new   sustained old  new
    ffn_down 9216x2560 at 1024   128 x 96      352 x 32      4227 us    3516 us     5186 us    4633 us
    ffn_down 9216x2560 at 512    128 x 96      352 x 32      2068 us    1781 us     2847 us    2479 us
    4096x2560 at 1024            384 x 192     576 x 128     1621 us    1610 us     2192 us    2123 us
    4096x2560 at 512             288 x 224     512 x 128      834 us     790 us     1136 us    1039 us
    ffn_gate, ffn_up at 1024     576 x 288     1024 x 128    3087 us    3053 us     4071 us    4136 us
    attn_k, attn_v at 1024       672 x 256     1024 x 128     544 us     510 us      626 us     598 us
    MTP ffn_down F16 at 1024     192 x 64      320 x 32      8217 us    6513 us     8977 us    7466 us
    MTP eh_proj F16 at 1024      288 x 128     544 x 64      3337 us    2650 us     3962 us    3254 us
    2560x9216 at 32              32 x 480      32 x 480       413 us     418 us      421 us     422 us

The time of one chunk: 2560x9216 at 32 tokens (one pass, the DMA sets the time) with n chunks of 480, 128,
64 and 32 gives 413, 456, 571 and 761 us for 20, 72, 144 and 288 chunks. Thus a chunk adds 1.3 to 1.6 us
where the chunks are small, which is in the range 0 to 5 us that gives the same selections.

The profile lines of the stage give the chunks of the plan table for each op of the old and the new model.
test-backend-ops test mode passes the 29 MUL_MAT cases of the 4B shapes (5 to 1024 tokens) with the new
model.

mmcheck (tools/stages/mmsolve/mmcheck.cpp, the stage mmsolve-bx) gives a hash of the HTP0 output of 33
cases: the 4B shapes at 5 to 1024 tokens as MUL_MAT, MUL_MAT_NX and MUL_MAT+ADD, with Q8_0 weights and
with the F16 weights of the MTP block. The old model, the new model and the request 0,32 give the same
hash in each case, and the new model with the fusion off gives the same hash too. Each case has 0 values
that are not finite. The NMSE against the CPU backend of the phone is 1.4e-5 for Q8_0 and 3.6e-6 to
6.4e-6 for F16.

